049]" drawing-order="3" hint=""><node index="0" text="I am trying to learn more about my symptoms. I have POTS, MCAS, ehlers danlos syndrome, hypermobility syndrome, and we are continuing to learn more. &#10;&#10;I go to a specialist named Brad once a month to get updates, and adapt my lifestyle/medication. &#10;&#10;I take One B12 Folate a day. One Vitamin D3 (25 mcg (5,000IU)), 60MG of Pyridostigmine (1½ 3 times a day. morning, afternoon, night) &#10;&#10;I try to get in 6,000 electrolytes and a cup of salt (counting the salt in the electrolytes and 250mg salt pills) (I drink liquid IV/Water Boy hydration specifically the weekend version)&#10;&#10;I get migraines usually every day. I've noticed that they show up specifically every time I go over a heart rate of 160bpm&#10;&#10;I wear compression on my calf, socks, shorts, and a band that goes around my chest for my ribs. &#10;&#10;I have a handicap pass for my car.&#10;&#10;I am try and get in a gallon of water a day. &#10;&#10;I am going to physical therapy for my ehlers danlos syndrome (it is causing pain mainlyin my ribs and back as well as scoliosis" resource-id="" class="android.widget.EditText" package="com.notel.notel" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="false" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,677][996,1049]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.notel.notel" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,677][996,1049]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.notel.notel" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollabl